A dish of Maluns and apple compote. Served along with various specialities and products of the Grisons, from left to right:
Walnut pie from Sedrun (Surselva), produced by La Conditoria;
Apples from Campascio (Val Poschiavo), produced by Paganini Frutta;
Grisons Meat from Churwalden (Plessur), produced by Mani - Fleischtrocknerei Churwalden;
Old alp cheese from Nufenen (Rheinwald), produced by Sennerei Nufenen;
Salsiz from Schiers (Prättigau), produced by Albert Spiess; Serviervorschlag. Zutatenmengen und genaue Käsesorten nicht aus dem Foto überprüfbar.
